  "prefLabel": "Liq 501.02 Roster of Members",
  "priorExpiration": "2004-11-28",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Liq 501.02 Roster of Members. Club licensees shall have a roster of their members and auxiliaries with their names, addresses, and date upon which each member joined the club, kept on the licensed premises for inspection by the commission or its investigators at all times.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Liq 500) #5043, eff 1-11-91; ss by #6391, eff 11-28-96, EXPIRED: 11-28-04\n\nNew. #8450, eff 10-21-05; ss by #10647, eff 7-24-14; ss by #13461, eff 10-13-22",
